<div class="usb-tool install-steps" data-tool="webusb">
<section><h2>1. Activate Fastboot</h2>
<p>This requires root and shell access granted in the previous step. It will download a partition backup, prepare the unlock and restart the phone into fastboot.</p>
<button id="unlock-primary">Activate Fastboot</button>
<div id="unlock-status" class="step-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
</section>
<section><h2>2. Unlock the bootloader</h2>
<p>Select your phone again in fastboot. Press Volume Down once, then press the lock button on your phone. Your phone will reboot into LightOS. Unlocking erases your data.</p>
<button id="unlock-request">Select phone and unlock</button>
<div id="unlock-fastboot-status" class="step-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
</section>
</div>
<script>
  import '../webusb/app.js';
</script>
